# Production Security Note:
# Crumb & Tier uses Firebase AI Logic (com.google.firebase:firebase-ai) protected by
# Firebase App Check (Play Integrity / Debug Provider) instead of embedding a client-side
# GEMINI_API_KEY inside BuildConfig or the APK.
#
# Do NOT uncomment or package GEMINI_API_KEY in production builds, as Android APKs can be
# decompiled. Instead, place your project's google-services.json in app/google-services.json
# and enable Firebase AI + App Check in the Firebase Console.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=MY_GEMINI_API_KEY
